{"step_index":151,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-23T11:23:30Z","content":"Perfect! I have successfully created the repository and pushed the complete app code to your GitHub.\n\nYou can view it here: **https://github.com/ngwaijian/stock-screener**\n\nNow, to permanently publish the app online (so you can open it on your phone or any device, anywhere), just follow these final 3 clicks:\n\n1. Go to **[share.streamlit.io](https://share.streamlit.io/)** and sign in with your GitHub account.\n2. Click the big **\"Create app\"** button.\n3. Choose **\"Yep, I have an app\"** and fill in the following:\n   *   **Repository:** type `ngwaijian/stock-screener`\n   *   **Main file path:** type `stock_screener.py`\n4. Click **Deploy!**\n\nWait about 1-2 minutes for the servers to bake it, and it will give you a public web URL! \n\nYou can then open that URL on your smartphone browser, tap the browser menu, and select **\"Add to Home Screen\"**. It will install an app icon on your phone so you can check your stock signals every day with just a tap!"}
